    "ダブルタップで台札に出します" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Double-tap to play it onto a pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ダブルタップで選択中の札を置きます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Double-tap to place the selected card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "トランプを赤（♥♦）と黒（♠♣）の26枚ずつに分け、あなたが赤、CPU が黒を使います。手札は4枚。真ん中の台札2山に、手札から札を重ねていきます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The deck is split into 26 red cards (♥♦) and 26 black cards (♠♣). You play red and the CPU plays black. You hold 4 cards and stack them onto the 2 center piles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出し切り" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All played"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "playable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playable cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札があればいつでも出せます。CPU も同時に出してくるので、早い者勝ちです。あなたの側に制限時間はありません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a card whenever you can. The CPU plays at the same time, so the quicker hand gets there first. You have no time limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勝ち" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Win"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札と1つ違いの札を、CPU より先に出し切ろう。速さは3段階" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play cards one up or down on the piles and empty your hand before the CPU. 3 paces"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札と1つ違いの札を出してください" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a card one up or down from a pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札の数字と1つ違いの札（台札が7なら6か8）。A と K もつながります。マークは関係ありません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any card one up or down from a pile's top card (on a 7, play a 6 or 8). A and K connect, too. Suits don't matter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右の台札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Right pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左の台札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Left pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだにゲームが終わったか、負けそうな局面ではなくなったため、タイムを取れませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ended, or you were no longer about to lose, while the ad was playing, so no time-out was given."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見てタイム（CPU が8秒休む）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an ad for a time-out (CPU rests 8s)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
