    "負けそうなとき（CPU の残りが8枚以下で、あなたより少ないとき）、広告を見ると1ゲームに1回だけ CPU が8秒休みます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're about to lose (the CPU has 8 or fewer cards left, and fewer than you), watch an ad to make the CPU rest for 8 seconds. Once per game."
